Reason: Let the Outland copy (map 753, the bounty acts' act 5) read its liquid as Outland does: liquid type 2 is green lava (15) there too.
Target: AzerothCore at core-commit.txt, after patches 0001-0022. Map 530 and every other map are stock.

--- a/src/server/game/Maps/Map.cpp
+++ b/src/server/game/Maps/Map.cpp
@@ -48,6 +48,15 @@
 
 #define MAP_INVALID_ZONE        0xFFFFFFFF
 
+// Torment's Outland copy (map 753, mod-diablocraft/data/d3/world_open_rift_outland_dbc.csv; core patch 0023) reads its
+// liquid as Outland does: the client's map-530 rule turns liquid type 2 into 15, green lava.
+static constexpr uint32 MAP_OUTLAND_COPY = 753;
